{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の中川智尋です ‹:)⁾⁾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近帽子を集めるのにハマっています"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日のミーグリでは、ベレー帽を被りました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "チェック柄が王道アイドルみたいでお気に入りなんです〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobWXWt4H.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob8wWCEM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thはじめてのミーグリでした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生ライブの感想教えてもらったり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このシングルのお話できたり♩"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "近況を話し合ったり…ね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめましてもたーくさん出来て、にこにこ止まりませんでした☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもたくさん褒めてくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "褒められて伸びるタイプなので、助かります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近個人PVのオフショットを整理していたら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "怪しい影が…"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob2qAATz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは…！！！？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobu6igFb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "君かー！！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリで「とりきちのこと、久々に見れて安心した」という声が多かったので良かったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "彼は元気です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『放課後パニック・レディオ』"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん見てください🙂‍↕️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobVVFPDv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね！♡"}], "source": "official"}